## Security checklist

- [ ] Confirm `ssh_cidrs` is not `0.0.0.0/0` in production
- [ ] Review NSG / SG / firewall rules before exposing workloads
- [ ] Enable backend encryption and restrict IAM on state bucket
- [ ] Wire CI OIDC instead of long-lived cloud keys
- [ ] Run `checkov -d .` and `tflint` before merge

